<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Mar-May unemployment 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Mar-May unemployment 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department gave the following seasonally adjusted figures on Tuesday as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Mar-May*  Feb-Apr   Nov-Jan   Feb-Apr</p>
<p>			 1997	1997     1996/97    1996</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.5	 2.6	 2.5	 3.3</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.3	 1.2	 1.4	 1.8</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
